{"id":"72b151eab674506d","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-subdirectly-closure.md","title":"Subdirectly Irreducible Closure","display":"Subdirectly Irreducible Closure","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-subdirectly-closure","aliases":["93-cor-subdirectly-closure"],"display":"Subdirectly Irreducible Closure","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","[[93-thm-generated-variety]]","[[93-fact-subdirectly-closure]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-subdirectly-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-subdirectly-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Subdirectly Irreducible Closure"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8af34fe512640e2\" href=\"?note=d8af34fe512640e2\" title=\"93-thm-generated-variety\">93-thm-generated-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3bbb7b7bf7df9f89\" href=\"?note=3bbb7b7bf7df9f89\" title=\"93-fact-subdirectly-closure\">93-fact-subdirectly-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-subdirectly-closure---Subdirectly-Irreducible-Closure\">cor-subdirectly-closure - Subdirectly Irreducible Closure</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\">\\(K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}\\)</span> are the operators of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\nK\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\to\\forall\\mathbf A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathbf A\\in\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\nK\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\to\\forall\\mathbf A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathbf A\\in\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the pointwise form of the class inclusion and follows from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\\)</span>; it does not treat a predicate as a class term.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-subdirectly-closure---Subdirectly-Irreducible-Closure","text":"cor-subdirectly-closure - Subdirectly Irreducible Closure","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-thm-generated-variety","status":"resolved","id":"d8af34fe512640e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-thm-generated-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-fact-subdirectly-closure","status":"resolved","id":"3bbb7b7bf7df9f89","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-fact-subdirectly-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)$, $K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}$, and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{HSP}$ are the operators of [[93-df-variety]] and [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{HSP}$ are the operators of [[93-df-variety]] and [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HSP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\nK\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\to\\forall\\mathbf A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathbf A\\in\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)","display":false}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696